      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GALLOPING JESSIE (1) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from six starts. Missed the frame latest (24.65) when fifth over 425m at this track in a Grade 5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. GREEN FROG CAFE (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Warragul in a handy 26.23 beating Playback. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. KENZIE KID (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.17) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Warragul. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. MIGHTY HEIGHTY (8) has definite claims at his first try at this circuit.",
